{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんと全握ペアだったよ(*´`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなであることが今日は少なかった気がする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カナヲか中田'16で常にいた( 笑 )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白かった、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんくにくるまれて居心地が良かった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/28/8680953/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調大丈夫ー？って心配させちゃったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜんぜん元気(｡-_-｡)ごめんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクかわいいから着てた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(寒くてさ、、、)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中脱ぐタイミング失ってずっと着てた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた人ありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/28/8680953/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬくぬく○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼に卵かけご飯を食べた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/02/28/8680953/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし世界が終わるなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にしたいことは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界1美味しい卵かけごはんを食べながら寝たいなーっていうのが第一希望、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卵かけごはん最高"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしも今日で終わりだとしたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アカシックさんに会いにFEVERへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FEVERでFEVERした○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイダーガールさんのツアーファイナルっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイダーガールさんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンテンポラリーな生活さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめてライブ見たけど何故か涙出た！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいかっこいい！サイダーガールさん曲結構知ってたから生で聴けたの感動！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アカシックさんはめっちゃすきで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のduoでのワンマンも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織とお邪魔してたの(｡･ω･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうアカシックさん最高やな( ･ᴗ･̥̥̥ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵すぎる、、始まる前からずっとドキドキやけどさ、始まった瞬間なんか周りが見えなくなるというか１対アカシック的な自分だけの世界にはいって心臓がバクバクなってときめくの、勝手に体がキモチイイってなる(語彙力)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アカシックさんの曲をきくとめっちゃ頑張ろうって思えるの。朝聴いてテンションアゲルの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムひと足先にいただいたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良曲すぎて気分りんりんなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンデイバージンディアボーイと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恋は媚薬だなんて冷めるわが特にすきだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/